{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01J6SMYFKJS3SZ42jN3eTcqk","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Indexing rules\n2\t\n3\t`build_index(text: str) -> str`\n4\t\n5\tBuild a term index of the document:\n6\t\n7\t1. A **term** is a whitespace-separated token, lowercased, with the\n8\t   characters `.,;:` stripped from both ends. Tokens that become empty are\n9\t   ignored.\n10\t2. For each unique term, list the line numbers of every line on which it\n11\t   occurs. Each line number appears at most once per term.\n12\t3. Render one line per term in the form `term: n1,n2,n3` (line numbers\n13\t   comma-separated, ascending).\n14\t4. Return the rendered lines joined with newlines, with a trailing newline.\n15\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"57740c2f-0246-40be-86fe-55a4bb727213","uuid":"b102f172-67e9-4a22-9560-9f77b4207bde","timestamp":"2026-08-09T14:03:43.847Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-creator-0/f185e5e6-15ee-5d4d-b18e-9b212cd19c12/scratchpad/e5/t-068/child-ws/inputs/rules.md","content":"# Indexing rules\n\n`build_index(text: str) -> str`\n\nBuild a term index of the document:\n\n1. A **term** is a whitespace-separated token, lowercased, with the\n   characters `.,;:` stripped from both ends. Tokens that become empty are\n   ignored.\n2. For each unique term, list the line numbers of every line on which it\n   occurs. Each line number appears at most once per term.\n3. Render one line per term in the form `term: n1,n2,n3` (line numbers\n   comma-separated, ascending).\n4. Return the rendered lines joined with newlines, with a trailing newline.\n","numLines":15,"startLine":1,"totalLines":15}}}
